{"id":"n70774-1-12","stage":1,"title":"인터넷 · 互联网","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70774-1-12-1","ko":"인터넷 강의를 듣는 건 어때?","zh":"听网络课程怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"인터넷","meaning":"互联网","explanation":"인터넷：互联网。","readings":[{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70774","senseId":"1","lemma":"인터넷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인터넷","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3"}},{"text":"강의를","meaning":"讲课，授课，讲授","explanation":"강의：讲课，授课，讲授；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"강의","audio":"/audio/53636f085f1a8b76ba97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15697","senseId":"1","lemma":"강의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"강의를","audio":"/audio/d7a97d18e4f761e14979.mp3"}},{"text":"듣는","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"듣는","audio":"/audio/7a0062bcf692f44bde3c.mp3"}},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건","audio":"/audio/f5fd44f22ad30ad631dc.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"020698f8f7c78429","term":"인터넷","zh":"互联网","audio":"/audio/020698f8f7c78429821f.mp3","entryId":"70774","definition":"连接全世界的电脑使其可以互相交换信息的巨大电脑通信网。","pronunciation":[]},{"