104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으니까","audio":"/audio/77191203b1207a5b5b2c.mp3"}},{"text":"편하고","meaning":"方便","explanation":"편하다：方便；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"2","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편하고","audio":"/audio/7e700b164df175b0e28d.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"2186559acad40e79","term":"원하다","zh":"希望，想要","audio":"/audio/2186559acad40e79834f.mp3","entryId":"69570","definition":"期望或想做。","pronunciation":["원ː하다"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"方便","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"容易而简便。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e6e833074cb0977567f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70774","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https